    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>CHERNOBOTS</u></i></strong>\u00a0is a retro 3D roguelite set in the horrific and procedurally generated Chernobyl Exclusion Zone. Search for highly radioactive targets that are top priority for removal. Use remote controlled robots equipped with cameras, flashlights, radiation detectors &amp; more to get the job done. Avoid being destroyed by mutated animals or pay the price. Earn money for completing tasks and upgrade your robotics further.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE various PROCEDURALLY GENERATED areas within the CHERNOBYL EXCLUSION ZONE following the NUCLEAR POWER PLANT DISASTER: Pripyat City, Red Forest, and Power Plant areas</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SEARCH areas that are different every time</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIND radioactive targets that are top priority for RETRIEVAL and REMOVAL</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AVOID</strong>\u00a0<strong>mutated animals, HUNT them or be HUNTED</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EARN money for completing tasks</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UPGRADE remote controlled robots</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DISCOVER\u00a0digital intel that tells a deeper story</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INTERACT with realistic physics-based objects</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MANAGE your expenses and decontamination costs\u00a0</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUY upgrades for your robots and MORE</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679190/extras/1ee02b18c5c73a4c7e69c9a909e21599.avif?t=1753529643\" width=615 height=150 /></span></p>",
